# Tests (HabiTV)

- Run **targeted** module tests first:
  `mvn -B -ntp -pl <module> -am test`.
- Add or change tests only when they validate the requested behavior.
- Do not weaken or rewrite tests solely to hide a production bug.
- Prefer offline fixtures; live provider tests are opt-in
  (`-Plive-provider-tests`), never the default proof.
- Full reactor / package gates only when justified (Ready gate, packaging,
  or cross-module risk) — see `docs/development.md` and
  `.agents/skills/code-change-verification/SKILL.md`.
